Afterward, he brags that he will be the world's most powerful Trainer before warping away. Once he leaves, speak to the nearby office worker. Realizing that you are here to save them all, he would like to give you a Pokémon. If you have room in your party, he gives you a {{p|Lapras}}. They had been keeping it in their lab, but he thinks it would be much better off with you. Take the final warp panel to the west side of 11F.

====11F (West)====
Take out one last Rocket Grunt to reach the boardroom. Use the Card Key to open the door and confront [[Giovanni]]. He claims to be having some important business meeting with the company president and warns you to stay out of grown-up matters before drawing you into battle.

