===Lance===
One of [[Lance]]'s {{p|Dragonair}} has evolved into {{p|Dragonite}}, while the other has been replaced by {{p|Kingdra}}. Kingdra's {{2t|Water|Dragon}} typing means that it is only vulnerable to {{t|Dragon}} moves, while it can counter Dragon-type Pokémon with {{m|Ice Beam}}. Both of his Dragonite know moves to counter {{t|Water}} and {{2t|Water|Ice}} Pokémon that may attempt using Ice moves. His {{p|Gyarados}} can cover its weakness to {{t|Electric}} Pokémon with {{m|Earthquake}}, while his {{p|Aerodactyl}} can counter Ice-type Pokémon with {{m|AncientPower}}.

